stringToShow="Summon Info: Gaia#This was never available in any release.#Fun fact: Its sprite was never decided on.#It would follow you like Muuguru did and at certain intervals when an#enemy was close by, would pound the ground and deal earth damage#to all nearby enemies on the ground. This had the added effect of#making you jump slightly higher if you jumped at the time it hit the ground."
